In one file, debug mode highlights both declarators of `const first…, second…` and of `let x…, y…` by name, and an anonymous `export default class` through `class`.
== args
--debug
input/multi-feature.ts
== file input/multi-feature.ts
const first = 1, second = 2;

export default class {
  value = 42;
}

let x = 10, y = 20;
== stdout
«const first» = 1, «second» = 2;

«export default class» {
  value = 42;
}

«let x» = 10, «y» = 20;
== stderr
== exit 0
